{"suttaId":"thag16.7","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[3280,3335],"vripara":"842"},"segments":{"thag16.7:0.4":"Kāḷigodhāputtabhaddiyattheragāthā","thag16.7:1.1":"“Yātaṃ me hatthigīvāya, sukhumā vatthā padhāritā;","thag16.7:1.3":"Sālīnaṃ odano bhutto, sucimaṃsūpasecano.","thag16.7:2.1":"“Sojja bhaddo sātatiko, uñchāpattāgate rato;","thag16.7:2.3":"Jhāyati anupādāno, putto godhāya bhaddiyo.","thag16.7:3.1":"“Paṃsukūlī sātatiko, uñchāpattāgate rato;","thag16.7:3.3":"Jhāyati anupādāno, putto godhāya bhaddiyo.","thag16.7:4.1":"“Piṇḍapātī sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:5.1":"“Tecīvarī sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:6.1":"“Sapadānacārī sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:7.1":"“Ekāsanī sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:7.3":"“Pattapiṇḍī sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:9.1":"“Khalupacchābhattī sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:10.1":"“Āraññiko sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:11.1":"“Rukkhamūliko sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:12.1":"“Abbhokāsī sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:13.1":"“Sosāniko sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:14.1":"“Yathāsanthatiko sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:15.1":"“Nesajjiko sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:16.1":"“Appiccho sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:17.1":"“Santuṭṭho sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:17.3":"“Pavivitto sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:19.1":"“Asaṃsaṭṭho sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:20.1":"“Āraddhavīriyo sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:21.1":"“Hitvā satapalaṃ kaṃsaṃ, sovaṇṇaṃ satarājikaṃ;","thag16.7:21.3":"Aggahiṃ mattikāpattaṃ, idaṃ dutiyābhisecanaṃ.","thag16.7:22.1":"“Ucce maṇḍalipākāre, daḷhamaṭṭālakoṭṭhake;","thag16.7:22.3":"Rakkhito khaggahatthehi, uttasaṃ vihariṃ pure.","thag16.7:23.1":"“Sojja bhaddo anutrāsī, pahīnabhayabheravo;","thag16.7:23.3":"Jhāyati vanamogayha, putto godhāya bhaddiyo.","thag16.7:24.1":"“Sīlakkhandhe patiṭṭhāya, satiṃ paññañca bhāvayaṃ;","thag16.7:24.3":"Pāpuṇiṃ anupubbena, sabbasaṃyojanakkhayan”ti.","thag16.7:24.5":"… Bhaddiyo kāḷigodhāya putto thero …."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
